            "notes_base": "The iconic 1.8km pedestrian street — spine of Beijing's premier shopping district. Best for browsing brand flagships, street snacks, and souvenir shops. Start here to orient yourself before diving into the malls. Free entry. Notable brands: ZARA (No.241), Anta/安踏 PALACE flagship (No.247), Li-Ning/李宁 flagship (No.249), Wangfujing Watch City/王府井钟表城, Shengxifu/盛锡福 (百年帽店 old-brand hat shop). North end connects to Wangfujing Snack Street (王府井小吃街). Open 24 hours, individual stores 10:00-22:00.",
            "notes_local": "全长1.8公里，北京最著名购物步行街，是整个王府井商圈的核心主轴。适合边走边逛各大品牌旗舰店和街边小吃纪念品店，免费进入。品牌：ZARA（241号）、安踏PALACE旗舰店（247号）、李宁旗舰店（249号）、王府井钟表城、盛锡福百年老字号。北端通往王府井小吃街。24小时开放，各店铺10:00-22:00。",
