            "notes_base": "Rating 4.8/5. One of Beijing's most vibrant malls with a young, fashionable crowd. Best for: luxury entry-level, international fast fashion, sportswear, and beauty counters. Notable brands — 1F: GUCCI, CHANEL Beauty, COACH (#111), AMI Paris, APM Monaco (#147A), Lancome/兰蔻; 2F: Li-Ning/李宁; 3F: Adidas/阿迪达斯, Belle/百丽, MM; 4F: The Green Party; Within mall: Apple Store/苹果零售店. Connected directly to Jinyuhu Alley metro station. Budget allocation for 1-2 purchases: 300-800 CNY.",
            "notes_local": "评分4.8/5。王府井商圈最受年轻人喜爱的购物中心，国际快时尚+轻奢+美妆一应俱全。品牌分布：1F（GUCCI、CHANEL美妆、COACH #111、AMI Paris、APM Monaco #147A、兰蔻）；2F（李宁）；3F（阿迪达斯、百丽、MM）；4F（The Green Party）；及Apple Store。可直达地铁金鱼胡同站。单次购物预算300-800元。",
