            "notes_base": "Rating 4.7/5. Beijing's most historic department store, founded 1955. Two sections — Main Building and North Wing (北馆). Best for: jewelry, watches, cosmetics, and the basement gourmet supermarket. Notable brands/counters — 1F: IWC/万国表, Lukfook/六福珠宝; 2F: Ruan's Pearl/阮仕珍珠; North Wing 4F: Nike; North Wing 5F: Huawei/华为, Dell/戴尔, Asus/华硕, BOSE; B1: Elite Supermarket/精选超市 (great for snacks and local specialties). Budget: 200-1000 CNY for cosmetics/accessories; 3000+ for watches.",
            "notes_local": "评分4.7/5。北京历史最悠久的百货商场（1955年建），分主楼和北馆。重点：珠宝、腕表、美妆、地下精品超市。品牌：1F（万国表IWC、六福珠宝）；2F（阮仕珍珠）；北馆4F（Nike）；北馆5F（华为、戴尔、华硕、BOSE）；B1（精选超市，买零食特产）。美妆/配饰预算200-1000元，腕表3000元起。",
