            "notes_base": "Rating 4.7/5. North end of Wangfujing, near Dongsi area. Trendy mall popular with younger crowd. Notable highlights — 1F: THE GUNDAM BASE BEIJING/高达基地 (anime/hobby must-visit); 3F North #311: Haidilao/海底捞 hot pot (great for dinner); 3F: Green Tea Restaurant/绿茶餐厅; B1: Soloist/单立人DownTown (stand-up comedy venue); 2F: Cat Nip Community/猫薄荷社区 (cat cafe). Optional stop — visit if you have time after APM and Department Store.",
            "notes_local": "评分4.7/5。位于王府井北端，靠近东四。年轻潮流风格。亮点：1F（高达基地北京店，动漫爱好者必到）；3F北侧311（海底捞，晚餐选项）；3F（绿茶餐厅）；B1（单立人DownTown脱口秀）；2F（猫薄荷社区猫咖）。作为备选项，逛完apm和百货大楼后若有余力再来。",
