            "notes_base": "Rating 4.9/5 — highest rated mall in the entire Wangfujing area. Premium luxury mall at the southern end of Wangfujing. Two connected buildings: East Wing (东座) and West Wing (西座). More exclusive and less crowded than APM — better service for serious luxury purchases. Features high-end international fashion houses, premium jewelry, and fine dining. Optional stop for high-budget shoppers who want a calmer luxury experience.",
            "notes_local": "评分4.9/5，是整个王府井商圈评分最高的购物中心。位于王府井南端，分东座和西座。环境优雅、人流较少、服务更贴心，适合认真逛高端品牌。汇聚顶级国际时尚品牌、精品珠宝和高端餐厅。预算充足且想要舒适购物体验的可优先考虑。",
