            "notes_base": "Rating 4.7/5. Massive upscale retail complex stretching from Wangfujing to Dongdan along Chang'an Avenue. Multiple buildings (A, B, C wings + underground level). The Fifth Street (第五街) section focuses on international fashion. Underground level: Huawei Smart Life Store/华为智能生活馆 (CC25B), ECCO shoes (B1/Zone 4 BB51A). 2F has SWOFCARE and F&B options. Perfect midpoint between Wangfujing and Dongdan — walk through as a connector or spend time browsing. Grand Hyatt Beijing attached. Rating: 4.7/5.",
            "notes_local": "评分4.7/5。沿长安街连接王府井和东单的大型综合商业体，分A、B、C座及地下层。第五街区主打国际时尚品牌。地下层有华为智能生活馆（CC25B）、ECCO（B1四区BB51A）。2F有SWOFCARE及多家餐饮。是往返王府井与东单之间的理想中间站，可直达地铁王府井站。毗邻北京东方君悦大酒店。",
