            "notes_base": "Rating 4.7/5. Premium luxury mall slightly east of Wangfujing on Jinbao Street, in the Dongdan area. Features top-tier international luxury fashion houses and premium jewelry brands. Less tourist-heavy than the main Wangfujing strip — better service, quieter environment. Worth a detour for serious luxury purchases with a budget of 1000+ CNY per item. Fine dining and premium cafes on upper floors.",
            "notes_local": "评分4.7/5。位于东单商圈金宝街，距王府井步行约10分钟，汇聚顶级国际奢侈品牌和高端珠宝。游客相对少，购物氛围舒适，服务水准高。单件预算1000元以上的强烈推荐。楼上有精致餐厅和精品咖啡。",
