            "notes_base": "Rating 4.8/5. Also known as Xinyansha Jinjie Plaza/新燕莎金街购物广场. Located at the south end of Wangfujing, directly beside the metro station Exit E1 — most conveniently located mall in the area. Mix of international fast fashion, Chinese mid-range clothing, beauty and accessories. Good as a quick first or last stop when using the metro. Less premium but less crowded than APM.",
            "notes_local": "评分4.8/5，即新燕莎金街购物广场。位于王府井南端，紧邻地铁王府井站E1口（步行70米），是商圈内交通最便利的购物中心。国内外中端服装、美妆、配饰品牌混合，适合地铁出行时顺路逛一逛，不如apm档次高但人少不挤。",
